Hi Marc,

I didn't ask specifically about multivariate PSRF, there is a single-parameter
version of PSRF reported by gelman.diag() as well. Could be the same as
Rhat but I am not sure.

Having some reliable statistics that would replace the need for
skimming the traceplots would definitely be nice.

	Tomas

> Dear Tomas,
>
> I don't know how the multivariate PSRF ("one number for one model") works, but I think it is presumably a multivariate version of the single-parameter Rhat.
>
> I do think that even when you have hundreds of models, one should at least skim over the traceplots of some of the key params or even all.
>
> Best regards  --- Marc
>
> -----Ursprüngliche Nachricht-----
> Von: Tomas Telensky [mailto:tomas.t...@gmail.com]
